# Mood Palette – A Color-Based Mood Tracker & Visualizer

## Concept:
"Mood Palette" is a unique, visually-driven mood tracking app that lets users log their daily emotions by selecting colors instead of words. Each day, the user picks a color (or blend) that best represents their mood. The app builds a beautiful calendar and palette history, allowing users to visualize emotional trends over time in an artistic way.

This approach is innovative because it leverages color psychology for self-reflection and provides an intuitive interface for those who find it hard to express feelings verbally.

